.DS_Store

# Claude Code repo-local config is per-machine state (worktrees, scheduler locks,
# settings.local.json). The Backlog.md guard that used to live here is now a global
# PreToolUse hook in the agent config, so nothing under .claude/ is tracked.
.claude/

# Local safety archive of superseded working-tree state. Kept on disk, never a
# deliverable of this hub.
backups/

# Brainstorming specs and implementation plans are scratch, never deliverables.
# They still sync between machines via the codex-sync hook, which requires them
# to be gitignored — so do not "fix" this to make them travel.
docs/superpowers/
/superpowers/
codex/
